ARCHIVED — 'What is metabolic psychiatry?' section, removed from index.html on 2026-08-22
Replaced by the sign-up card that now sits directly under the hero.
To restore: put the HTML back after </header>, the CSS back in the LANDING block,
and the JS back before '/* ============ LANDING: FAQ ============ */'.
rough.js is NOT included here — it stays in index.html for the hero play triangle.

==================== HTML ====================
  <section class="sec" id="about">
    <div class="sec-inner center reveal">
      <h2>What is metabolic psychiatry?</h2>
      <p class="lead">An approach that understands mental health as a result of brain metabolism, integrating biological processes into the treatment of psychiatric disorders.</p>
      <div class="pyr-scene reveal">
        <div class="pyr-side">
